      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"finding a reason for myself\"... but there's no self left to find. there's just this endless, heavy nothing. it feels like i'm just haunting my own life. eventually, doesn't everyone just deserve to find some kind of peace? like, is it wrong to just want the noise to stop?",
